IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0045.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY CRD0045C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> ASSIGNED CREDIT LIMIT
    05 CREDIT-LIMIT       PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM SET-CARD-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-LIMIT=" CREDIT-LIMIT
    STOP RUN.
SET-CARD-LIMIT.
    IF CR-SCORE >= 760
        COMPUTE CREDIT-LIMIT = GROSS-INCOME * 0.30
    *> STANDARD CREDIT LIMIT
    ELSE IF CR-SCORE >= 680
        COMPUTE CREDIT-LIMIT ROUNDED = GROSS-INCOME * 0.20
    ELSE
        MOVE 1000 TO CREDIT-LIMIT
    END-IF
    END-IF.
